2.  **Understand Rho immune globulin:** Rho immune globulin contains anti-RhD antibodies. It is given to Rh-negative mothers who are exposed to Rh-positive fetal blood (e.g., during pregnancy, delivery, abortion, miscarriage, amniocentesis).
